The pg_mem_limit given to a container of this namespace that neither it, its
subset nor its object caps.

A claim counts what the containers are capped to, and one capped by nothing
cannot be counted: the default is what it is counted for and runs with. It
applies to the container resources and to the podman, docker and oci tasks.
The processes of the app resources are not given it: they are the object's
to cap.
